 And so, you know, as, as it's, uh, trickling down, it's, it's, it's getting really, really

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:01.980
 cleaned out by, by interaction with the limestone.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.580
 Um, so it's very clear water.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:07.500
 Um, and that was cool.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.460
 They let you swim in there.

