 Yeah, they are deep.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:57.460
 I mean, they, uh, they, they are, some of them are as deep as the pyramids are tall.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:58.900
 I mean, they are, they're pretty deep.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:04.180
 Not, not all of them are deep, but there's a lot of, um, there's a lot of ones that are

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.100
 like a hundred feet down.

